<title>CROATIA: Croatian Airlines to buy Airbus planes - agency.</title>
<headline>Croatian Airlines to buy Airbus planes - agency.</headline>
<text>
<p>ZAGREB, Nov 29 (Rreuter) - Croatia's state carrier Croatia an expansions of its fleet for almost a year, state news agency HINA reported on Friday.</p>
<p>The company's managing board had been considering offers from Airbus and Boeing.</p>
<p>The agency did not say when the first planes, from the purchase worth millions of dollars, would be bought.</p>
<p>-- Zagreb Newsroom, 385-1-4557075</p>
</text>
